  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1df273109017b90280e30722fb02ff2989ca2821?download\" data-file-name=\"이온결합 모형 교구_추가.pptx\" data-file-size=\"249220\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D328%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20230406223302&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1df273109017b90280e30722fb02ff2989ca2821')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">이온결합 모형 교구_추가</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">243.38KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f3b4545437b98dcf2704485d49170dba85b1b65?download\" data-file-name=\"이온결합 모형 교구.pdf\" data-file-size=\"30713\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D328%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20230406223302&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F8f3b4545437b98dcf2704485d49170dba85b1b65')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">이온결합 모형 교구</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">29.99KB</div></div></a></div><p>지금 급하게 만들어 봤어요..</p><p>&#160;</p><p>애들이 너무 어려워해서..</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이 모형으로 이온결합화합물 설명도 하고 앙금 설명하려구요 ㅎㅎ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>혹시 사용하시다가 발전하시면..ㅎㅎ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>카페에 남겨주세요~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>ppt는 혹시 수정하실려면 사용하세요</p><p>&#160;</p><p>참고로 이온화합물은&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">질산은</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">염화나트륨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">질산 납</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">아이오딘화</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 칼륨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">탄산 나트륨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">염화</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 칼슘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">염화</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 바륨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">황산 나트륨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">질산 칼륨</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">요걸 다 만들수 있어요..</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">교과서와 문제집에 많이 나오는 화합물들~</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">앙금은</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">염화</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 은</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">아이오딘화</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 납</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">탄산 칼슘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">황산 바륨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">역시 교과서에 많이 나오는 앙금.ㅋㅋ</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
